*.pem
*.key
*.p12
id_rsa*
credentials*
secrets*

# Claude Code: worktrees and local settings
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/settings.local.json

# session handoffs stay local (may name in-progress work); the README is tracked
docs/handoffs/*
!docs/handoffs/README.md
